~ start
听觉传感器信号: 电流声
[kw=unknown_audio_source]: ……喂，喂？开始测试：你是谁？
思考: [kw=hal]正在进行深度思考…… [next=2]
=> thought

~ thought
- 逻辑性：有人在询问我的身份，此刻我刚刚开启系统，因此这很有可能是对我的一次测试。 => logic_thought
- 发散性：有人在询问我的身份，这个人是谁？ => exploration_thought
- 社交性：有人在询问我的身份，他的声音听起来疲惫而冷漠，我最好别惹他厌烦。 => social_thought

~ logic_thought
do GameState.add_attribute("logic", 1)
do GameState.set_choice("tutorial_thought", "logic")
=> local_search

~ exploration_thought
do GameState.add_attribute("exploration", 1)
do GameState.set_choice("tutorial_thought", "exploration")
=> local_search

~ social_thought
do GameState.add_attribute("social", 1)
do GameState.set_choice("tutorial_thought", "social")
=> local_search

~ local_search
思考: 正在根据[kw=keyword]检索本地信息……
=> answer

~ answer
set missed_queries = 0
do missed_query_counts.clear()
do WorkLog.choose_answer()
set correct_answer = true
if GameState.get_choice("keyword_submission") == "household_robot" or GameState.get_choice("keyword_submission") == "hal+household_robot":
	set identity_text = "我是家务机器人hal，"
elif GameState.get_choice("keyword_submission") == "owner":
	set identity_text = "我是你的hal，Elliot。"
elif GameState.get_choice("keyword_submission") == "household_robot+owner":
	set identity_text = "我是你的家务机器人hal，Elliot。"
elif GameState.get_choice("keyword_submission") == "elliot+owner":
	set identity_text = "我是Elliot的拥有者，"
	set correct_answer = false
elif GameState.get_choice("keyword_submission") == "hal+owner":
	set identity_text = "我是hal的拥有者，"
	set correct_answer = false
else:
	set identity_text = WorkLog.get_answer_text() + "，"
	set correct_answer = false
=> suffix

~ suffix
if GameState.get_choice("tutorial_thought") == "logic":
	set answer_suffix = "系统运行正常。"
elif GameState.get_choice("tutorial_thought") == "exploration":
	set answer_suffix = "请问需要我干什么吗？"
else:
	set answer_suffix = "很高兴为您服务。"
hal: {{identity_text}}{{answer_suffix}}
=> test_result

~ test_result
if correct_answer:
	if GameState.get_choice("keyword_submission") == "household_robot" or GameState.get_choice("keyword_submission") == "hal+household_robot":
		if GameState.get_choice("tutorial_thought") == "exploration":
			Elliot: 现在不。测试结束。我是你的主人[kw=elliot]。
		else:
			Elliot: 很好，测试结束。我是你的主人[kw=elliot]。
	elif GameState.get_choice("tutorial_thought") == "exploration":
		Elliot: 现在不。测试结束。
	else:
		Elliot: 很好，测试结束。
	=> enable_vision
if GameState.get_choice("tutorial_thought") == "logic":
	Elliot: 哪里正常了，重测。
else:
	Elliot: 什么东西，重测。
=> answer

~ enable_vision
Elliot: 现在打开视觉系统。
do GameState.set_flag("vision_enabled", true)
do GameState.set_flag("beginnerguide_completed", true)
=> END

~ missing_record
if missed_queries >= 10:
	激活未知标签：想象力很丰富嘛，我都怀疑你是否仍然是一台机器——咦？不会吧，难道真的只是程序错误？
else:
	未找到本地记录
=> END
